    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "−δνJ = −δ(SM − v) = δv − δ i0∗p∗ϕ = δv − p∗i∗0δϕ. Together with −δνJ = p∗i∗0i∗1bJ, we have"
  }, {
